<title>JAPAN: BOJ to hold branch managers' meeting on Jan 20-21.</title>
<headline>BOJ to hold branch managers' meeting on Jan 20-21.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) will hold a two-day regular meeting of its branch managers at its headquarters in Tokyo from January 20 to 21, the BOJ said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The statement also said BOJ Governor Yasuo Matsushita will hold a regular news conference on January 22 starting at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT).</p>
</text>
